      "updated_at": "2018-09-17T09:28:35Z",
      "body": "We were discussing this issue with our data privacy officer. According to him, a double opt-in would be the best case scenario to have a double validation. However, a single opt-in upon registration i.e. \"If you continue with the registration you agree to the above terms\" with a confirmation e.g. via button-press or checking a box is sufficient. In any case, the confirmation has to be saved with the data privacy statement, ideally in a printable form to be archived locally.\r\nBut I can ask the specific requirements in these regards, ideally with a link to an official site.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
