      "updated_at": "2018-10-07T10:56:57Z",
      "body": "I'll second the request for the privacy page. For integration into our identity federation, they require a privacy statement (PDF or HTML page). From our understanding, for scientific data integrity, the user cannot request to delete all information associated with them and instead must ask individually from each group administrator if they wish to delete data that is in an experiment. Otherwise, it would be like someone from the university taking scissors to a physical lab notebook.\r\n\r\n",
