      "updated_at": "2018-10-07T19:50:01Z",
      "body": "We were discussing data privacy in terms of scientific data at our insitute as well. According to our data privacy officer, it can be requested to delete personal information, i.e. mail address and telefone number along with other information visible on the team tab. I agree with @TheGreatFox that a full deletion of all scientific data cannot be requested but it is neither personal nor private data anyway.\r\n\r\nRegarding a privacy statement: A default version in elabFTW is definitely a nice to have, but it should be customizable according to specific needs. We are currently waiting for a translation of our universities statement into English that could serve as a template.",
