      "body": "We finally received the translation of our privacy statement, we just need to fill out some missing points on what is actually stored by elabFTW. @NicolasCARPi Can you provide a list of information that is logged while using elabFTW? There's the obvious such as email and full name but maybe there are some \"hidden\" logs such as revisions with name and time which may be connected to [Issue #924](https://github.com/elabftw/elabftw/issues/924). \r\n",
