      "updated_at": "2019-03-13T18:12:53Z",
      "body": "Ok this is now implemented. See commit message:\r\n\r\ncreate a privacy_policy config entry editable by sysadmin\r\ndefault is null and no checkbox is show upon registration\r\nafter edition of the default template, a check box is shown on the\r\nregister page with a link to the policy (displayed in the page on click)\r\n\r\n![2019-03-13-191126_600x221_scrot](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3043706/54303644-c191ae00-45c3-11e9-82cd-d2313655c2fb.png)\r\n\r\nThe template can be seen here: https://github.com/elabftw/elabftw/blob/hypernext/src/templates/privacy-policy.html\r\n\r\nWe will see later if some modifications need to be made for better compliance, but I think as a first step it's pretty good :)",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
